    <section id="overview">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>One course for the real production layer around AI.</h2>
          <p>Not only model training. Not only prompting. This track connects GenAI development with DevOps, MLOps, LLMOps and AIOps so learners understand how AI systems are shipped and operated professionally.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cards">
          <div class="card"><div class="iconbox"><svg class="svgicon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 4h16v16H4z"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 13h5"/></svg></div><h3>Build AI Services</h3><p>Create GenAI APIs, model services and agentic application backends with clean project structure.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><div class="iconbox"><svg class="svgicon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3v12"/><path d="M7 8l5-5 5 5"/><path d="M5 21h14"/></svg></div><h3>Deploy with DevOps</h3><p>Use GitHub, CI/CD, Docker, Kubernetes and cloud workflows to move AI apps into production.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><div class="iconbox"><svg class="svgicon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 16l4-5 3 3 5-8"/></svg></div><h3>Operate with AIOps</h3><p>Monitor logs, metrics, traces, incidents, cost and latency using AI-assisted troubleshooting.</p></div>
